    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτροπ-άδην</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτρόπ-δᾱν</span></b> , Adv.,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτρέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned forwards</i>, i.e. <i>headforemost, with
				headlong speed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φοβέοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.304
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σπεύδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεύγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					221b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.28.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.4.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὤσασθαι</span> to drive
				<i>headlong</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμαις ψευδέσι π. πεσοῦνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.432
				</span></i>
			.</div>
